      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1948, Whitehall opened the first shopping center strip in the country, called Casto's Town and Country, pioneering suburban retail.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
