      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Lustron Home, a rare prefabricated steel house, sits at the south end of Whitehall Community Park and serves as the historical society headquarters.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
